Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:35.76,Kick,,0,0,0,,VILLAGE · EXPLAINED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:35.76,Title,,0,0,0,,₹5,000 FOR\NDROUGHT FARMERS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:35.76,Foot,,0,0,0,,Source: Deccan Chronicle · ANI via Republic\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}₹5,000 EACH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Maharashtra is paying drought hit farmers five thousand rupees each. Here is why critics say it is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.81,0:00:16.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The government estimated the cost at six thousand crore rupees, reaching about one crore ten lakh to one crore twenty lakh farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:21.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Mister Fadnavis called it unprecedented, and said it cannot cover all losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:26.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Each eligible farmer gets at least five thousand rupees now, and the rest is paid later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:31.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Opposition parties and farmers have criticised the amount as too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.39,0:00:35.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A loan waiver for another three and a half lakh farmers is also to begin.
